## 1. Purpose

This policy sets Contoso Demo Bank residential mortgage underwriting limits. The owning committee is the {{ facts.owning_committee_residential }}. It is effective {{ doc.effective_date }}.

## 2. Scope

Applies to first-lien owner-occupied, investment, and cash-out residential mortgages originated by the bank. Home-equity lines follow the cash-out LTV cap.

## 3. Thresholds

- Maximum LTV for an owner-occupied residential mortgage is {{ facts.max_ltv_owner_occupied }}.
- Maximum LTV for an investment residential mortgage is {{ facts.max_ltv_investment }}.
- Maximum DTI for residential mortgages is {{ facts.max_dti_residential }}.
- A high-DTI exception to {{ facts.high_dti_exception }} requires the {{ facts.high_dti_exception_authority }}.
- Minimum credit score for residential mortgages is {{ facts.min_credit_score_residential }}.
- Cash-out refinance maximum LTV is {{ facts.cash_out_max_ltv }}.

## 4. Authority

The {{ facts.owning_committee_residential }} owns this policy. Exceptions beyond the high-DTI path follow the Exceptions and Override Policy.

## 5. Related policies

See Exceptions and Override (CP-EXC-2026-01), Collateral Valuation (CP-COL-2026-01), and Delegated Credit Authority (CP-AUTH-2026-01).
